           TestSuite "Hiker"

           TestCase "life, the universe, and everything"
           PERFORM CALCULATE-ANSWER
           EXPECT WS-ANSWER TO BE 42

           TestCase "the answer is less than 50"
           PERFORM CALCULATE-ANSWER
           EXPECT WS-ANSWER < 50

           TestCase "the answer is not 54"
           PERFORM CALCULATE-ANSWER
           EXPECT WS-ANSWER NOT TO BE 54
